     "ok": true,
     "why": "worst relative error of any robot's mean wheel rate against ITS OWN command.  The commands cycle, so an engine that simulates one robot and copies it lands every clone on one target and reds here",
     "key": "wheel_omega_worst"
    },
    {
     "name": "roll_overrun_worst",
